Subject: [PATCH] ath11k: nss: deliver IGMP exceptions to the host

The firmware defines a distinct IGMP exception type. Pass it through the
existing decapsulation/delivery helper so the host bridge receives its
membership control frames instead of dropping them as unsupported.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/nss.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/nss.c
@@ -984,6 +984,7 @@
 	}
 
 	switch(wifi_metadata->pkt_type) {
+	case NSS_WIFI_VDEV_EXT_DATA_PKT_TYPE_IGMP:
 	case NSS_WIFI_VDEV_EXT_DATA_PKT_TYPE_EAPOL:
 		ath11k_nss_deliver_rx(arvif->vif, skb, eth_decap,
 				      data_offs, napi);
